  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM st&#xf6;d till Manusher Jonno Foundation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM support for Manusher Jonno Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the intervention linked to the Manusher Jonno Foundation program
The purpose of this intervention has been to strengthen the result framework at Manusher Jonno Foundation (UM2016/10282, ID: 52170021).&#xa0; The aim is to produce two central Project documents:
1) The Theory of Change and,&#xa0;
2)&#xa0; the Result Framework.
Sida through the Embassy of Sweden procured NIRAS Indevelop (Ramavtal), to lead the work together with Manusher Jonno Foundation. To achieve the results workshops, interviews and meetings took place during 2017 with Manusher Jonno Foundation and the organizations linked to the program.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med avropet &#xe4;r att i enlighet med avtal med Sidas Partner Manusher Jonno Foundation erbjuda expertst&#xf6;d till MJF i f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;llande av f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsteori och resultatramverk f&#xf6;r projektet &quot;Strengthen civil society and public institutions to address combating gender based violence and build community resilience to adopt climate change.&quot;

Uppdragsbeskrivningen och NIRAS Indevelops svar p&#xe5; avrop och uppdragsbeskrivning f&#xf6;r uppdraget bifogas detta beslut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this call-off is to, in agreement with Sida&apos;s agreement with partner Manusher Jonno Foundation offer expertise for the completion of the Theory of Change and Result Framework  for Project &quot;Strengthen civil society and public institutions to address combating gender based violence and build community resilience to adopt climate change.&quot;

Terms of Reference and response to call off and ToR from NIRAS Indevelop for Assignment is attached to this decision.</narrative>
  </description>
